THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The license above covers EGRET's own code only. The components below are the work
of others, are redistributed here for convenience, and remain under their upstream
licenses. Nothing above relicenses them.

  scripts/gemma-0.98.5-linux-static-AMD64
      GEMMA (Zhou et al.), GPLv3.
      https://github.com/genetics-statistics/GEMMA

  scripts/gcta_nr_robust
      GCTA (Yang et al.), GPLv3, as the modified build distributed with FUSION.
      https://github.com/jianyangqt/gcta

  scripts/FUSION.compute_weights.R
  scripts/FUSION.assoc_test_trans.R
      FUSION (Gusev et al.), modified. Local changes are noted in each file header.
      http://gusevlab.org/projects/fusion/

  scripts/LDREF/
      1000 Genomes Phase 3 EUR LD reference panel, as distributed with FUSION.

  scripts/davies.R
  scripts/liu.R
  scripts/liumod.R
  scripts/qfc.so
      Davies' and Liu et al. methods for the distribution of quadratic forms in
      normal variables, from CompQuadForm.
      https://cran.r-project.org/package=CompQuadForm

  scripts/ModifiedPCOMerged.R
  scripts/ModifiedSigmaOEstimate.R
      trans-PCO, modified.
      https://github.com/liliw-w/Trans

GEMMA and GCTA are distributed under the GPLv3, which requires that corresponding
source be made available; both are public at the URLs above. gcta_nr_robust is a
modified GCTA build obtained from the FUSION distribution, and its specific patches
are not published upstream. qfc.so is a compiled object whose source is in the
CompQuadForm distribution.
